274
00:22:16,877 --> 00:22:17,744
OK?

275
00:22:21,882 --> 00:22:23,283
Custe o que custar.

276
00:22:31,191 --> 00:22:32,726
Doutor, há forças em jogo aqui

277
00:22:32,759 --> 00:22:34,094
