314
00:24:08,488 --> 00:24:09,723
Nós os esgotamos.

315
00:24:10,757 --> 00:24:11,424
Por favor.

316
00:24:15,061 --> 00:24:16,263
- Lara?

317
00:24:16,296 --> 00:24:17,397
- Desculpe.

318
00:24:17,430 --> 00:24:18,899
