432
00:30:17,357 --> 00:30:18,358
- Desculpe.

433
00:30:22,796 --> 00:30:24,631
Sinto falta de ser um time, sabe?

434
00:30:28,268 --> 00:30:31,070
Lara?

435
00:30:34,140 --> 00:30:35,709
- Não há nada de errado comigo Ronald.

436
00:30:35,743 --> 00:30:37,343
