01:07:07,366 --> 01:07:08,267
- Me salve.

927
01:07:08,301 --> 01:07:09,402
- Me salve.

928
01:07:09,435 --> 01:07:10,403
- Sangue de Cristo.

929
01:07:10,436 --> 01:07:11,270
- Sangue de Cristo.

